            "en-US": "• Added \"Very Large\" text size option between Large and Huge\n• Fixed skill names wrapping character-by-character at large font sizes\n• Fixed abandoning or cancelling crafting sessions refunding more materials than were consumed when preservation bonus was active\n• Fixed Elder Isle pet drops landing in inventory as items instead of registering as pets\n• Fixed Elder Isle combat not tracking kills for the bestiary or collection summary\n• Fixed Elder Isle combat not consuming or showing food, arrows"
          }
